### Restaurant Reservation API Tests
### Use these tests with VS Code REST Client extension or IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Total: 25+ test cases covering happy paths and error scenarios

### ====================
### RESTAURANT ENDPOINTS
### ====================

### 1. Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get restaurant details (with tables)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get restaurant tables
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/1/tables
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Check restaurant availability (happy path)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/1/availability?date=2025-12-25&guests=4
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Check availability for 2 guests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/2/availability?date=2025-12-20&guests=2
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. ERROR: Restaurant not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/999
Accept: application/json

###


### ====================
### CUSTOMER ENDPOINTS
### ====================

### 7. Get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Get customer by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Register new customer (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alice Johnson",
    "email": "alice.johnson@email.com",
    "phone": "+1 555-0102"
}

###

### 10. ERROR: Register customer with duplicate email (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Smith Copy",
    "email": "john.smith@email.com",
    "phone": "+1 555-0999"
}

###

### 11. ERROR: Register customer with invalid email (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Bad Email User",
    "email": "invalid-email",
    "phone": "+1 555-0103"
}

###

### 12. ERROR: Register customer with missing required fields (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": ""
}

###

### 13. Get customer reservations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1/reservations
Accept: application/json

###


### ====================
### RESERVATION ENDPOINTS
### ====================

### 14. Create reservation (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-25",
    "reservationTime": "19:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 15. Create reservation with specific table
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "tableId": 2,
    "customerId": 2,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-26",
    "reservationTime": "13:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 3
}

###

### 16. Get reservation details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 17. Confirm reservation (PENDING -> CONFIRMED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/confirm
Accept: application/json

###

### 18. Complete reservation (CONFIRMED -> COMPLETED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/complete
Accept: application/json

###


### ====================
### ERROR SCENARIOS - DOUBLE BOOKING
### ====================

### 19. First create a reservation for double booking test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 2,
    "tableId": 5,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-28",
    "reservationTime": "18:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 20. ERROR: Double booking - same table same time (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 2,
    "tableId": 5,
    "customerId": 2,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-28",
    "reservationTime": "18:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 21. ERROR: Booking in the past (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2020-01-01",
    "reservationTime": "19:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 22. ERROR: Booking outside opening hours (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-30",
    "reservationTime": "08:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 23. ERROR: Exceeding table capacity (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "tableId": 1,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "reservationTime": "19:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 10
}

###

### 24. ERROR: Customer not found (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "customerId": 999,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "reservationTime": "19:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 2
}

###

### 25. ERROR: Reservation not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/999
Accept: application/json

###

### 26. ERROR: Invalid number of guests - zero (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 1,
    "customerId": 1,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "reservationTime": "19:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 0
}

###


### ====================
### STATUS TRANSITION TESTS
### ====================

### 27. Create a new reservation for status tests
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 3,
    "customerId": 3,
    "reservationDate": "2025-12-27",
    "reservationTime": "20:00:00",
    "numberOfGuests": 4
}

###

### 28. Confirm the reservation
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/confirm
Accept: application/json

###

### 29. Complete the reservation
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/complete
Accept: application/json

###

### 30. ERROR: Try to cancel completed reservation (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/cancel
Accept: application/json

###

### 31. ERROR: Try to confirm already completed reservation (409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/2/confirm
Accept: application/json

###

### 32. Cancel a pending reservation (happy path)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/3/cancel
Accept: application/json

###


### ====================
### REVIEW SYSTEM (BONUS)
### ====================

### 33. ERROR: Create review for non-completed reservation (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reservationId": 3,
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "This should fail - reservation not completed"
}

###

### 34. Create review for completed reservation (happy path)
# Note: First ensure reservation 2 is completed (use step 29)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reservationId": 2,
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "Excellent food and service! The pasta was amazing and the staff was very friendly. Highly recommended!"
}

###

### 35. ERROR: Duplicate review for same reservation (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reservationId": 2,
    "rating": 4,
    "comment": "Trying to review again - should fail"
}

###

### 36. Get review by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 37. Get restaurant ratings and reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/restaurant/3
Accept: application/json

###

### 38. Get customer reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/customer/3
Accept: application/json

###

### 39. ERROR: Review with invalid rating (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reservationId": 1,
    "rating": 10,
    "comment": "Invalid rating - should fail"
}

###


