### RESTAURANT RESERVATIONS
### ====================

### 40. Get all reservations for restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/1/reservations
Accept: application/json

###

### 41. Get all reservations for restaurant 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/2/reservations
Accept: application/json

###


### ====================
### AVAILABILITY CHECK TESTS
### ====================

### 42. Check availability after making reservations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/1/availability?date=2025-12-25&guests=2
Accept: application/json

###

### 43. Check availability for large party
GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants/2/availability?date=2025-12-25&guests=8
Accept: application/json

